# The Wi-Fi joined from ネットワーク設定 through the Wi-Fi simulator on the x64 PC
# (docs/tessronos/09-network.md 9.6.12), for tools/x64/ui_run64.py with the image of
# make TARGET=_X64_ DESKTOP=1 UITEST=1 WIFI_SIM=1 BUILD_ID=simui sdimg. The simulator's station is
# the card (iwm0, Simulated Wi-Fi) and its access point TessronOS-Sim (WPA2-Personal, passphrase
# wifisim-pass-2026, DHCP from 192.168.77.100), so no wifitest is asked. The places are those of
# tools/x64/tests/ui_wifikey.steps and ui_netadp.steps: 〈Ｗｉ－Ｆｉ〉 at 437,163, the scan's first
# row at 505,321, the password at 463,432, 保存 at 385,466, 接続 at 481,466; システム環境設定's
# adapters' list (自動 420,396, virtio-net 420,413, the Wi-Fi 420,430) and 設定 at 609,554.
# The network is saved with its password and joined from the part (4-way handshake on both
# sides), the Wi-Fi is then chosen as the adapter, and DHCP gives its address over it.
expect wifisim: AP "TessronOS-Sim", WPA2-Personal
open 01a0d8c4-52b5-7a41-8c61-2d7e9f0a1b31
expect netenv: ready
wait 800
click 437 163
expect netenv: scan 1 networks, 1 shown
wait 2000
shot ws_list
click 505 321
wait 2000
click 463 432
wait 1000
text wifisim-pass-2026
wait 2000
click 385 466
expect wifi: saved a network, a new key: 0 (wpa2)
expect netenv: wifi changed
wait 2000
click 481 466
expect netenv: wifi joined as saved
expect wifi: handshake -> connected
# the page read again as the card tells it changed, nothing looked at in between
expect netenv: wifi state connected
expect wifisim: AP: the port of 02:77:73:00:00:02 opened
wait 3000
shot ws_connected
absent !OACV!
# the adapter: the Wi-Fi chosen, and the address from the simulated network's DHCP
open 01a0d8c4-52b6-7b52-9d72-3e8fa01b2c42
wait 3000
click 270 201
wait 500
click 706 185
expect sysenv: adapters 2
wait 1500
shot ws_adapters
click 420 430
wait 2500
click 609 554
expect sysenv: adapter wifi: 0
expect net: adapter chosen: wifi
expect net: DHCP address 192.168.77.100
wait 1500
shot ws_adapter_wifi
absent !OACV!
